    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir49">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e98">Caput 49</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_1@1-2">Memoria Josiae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir49-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir49-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Memoria Josiae regis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ipse zelo Dei mundat terram Judae et Jerusalem ab omnibus abominationibus, qui ait: <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e119" source="http://scta.info/resource/io2_17@9-13">Zelus domus tuae comedit me.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e126">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_5@1-6">Praeter David, et Ezechiam, et Josiam,</quote>
            etc. Hi tres comparatione aliorum non dicuntur peccasse. Quod enim peccaverunt, condigna poenitentia deleverunt, et devotione et pietate Deo placuerunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e135">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e137">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e139">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1228D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_8@1-4">Incenderunt electa civitatem sanctitatis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir49-Rd1e146"><name xml:id="gom-sir49-Nd1e147" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e150"><seg type="qs">Quidam hunc locum in persona Christi intelligunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">his autem destructis, aedificavit Ecclesiam Dei.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e161">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_10@1-3">Ezechiel qui vidit,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir49-Rd1e168"><name xml:id="gom-sir49-Nd1e169" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e172"><seg type="qs">Mystice, Ezechiel</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et poenitentibus praedixisse remedia.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e182">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e184">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e186">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e188" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_11@5-6">In imbre.</quote>
            Significat quod praedicaverit super peccatores venturam esse pluviam vindictae, et per viam mandatorum Dei gradientibus promiserit consolationem misericordiae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e195">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e197">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e199" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_13@4-6">Nam et ipse,</quote>
            etc. Quia Christum signat, qui est imago Dei: ut quicunque crediderit in Deum, hic quasi annulo signetur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e204">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e206">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e208">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1229A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e212" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_14@1-3">Et Jesum filium Josedec.</quote>
            Quia per gratiam Jesu Christi, qui est rex noster et sacerdos, post captivitatem diabolicae oppressionis, reaedificatur Ecclesia.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e217">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e219">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_15@2-2">Nehemias.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir49-Rd1e226"><name xml:id="gom-sir49-Nd1e227" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e230"><seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e232">Consolator Deus,</quote> vel <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e234">consolatus a Domino,</quote></seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui aedificat civitatem Dei, id est Ecclesiam, et consolatur moerentes.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e241">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e243">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e245">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e247" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_16@1-1">Nemo,</quote>
            etc. Enoch, <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e250">dedicatio.</quote> Hic Christum significat, qui aedificavit et consecravit Ecclesiam sanguine suo; qui sine peccato venit in mundum, et cum gloria suscepturus est in coelum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e254">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e256">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e258">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e260" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_17">Ut Joseph.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Joseph, sicut Jacob pater ejus, terram promissionis desiderabat, Aegyptum detestabatur; instruens nos ut desideremus terram <pb ed="#P" n="1229B"/> viventium, ut quiescamus in pace.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e270">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e272">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e274">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e276" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_18@1-5">Et ossa ipsius visitata sunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir49-Rd1e279"><name xml:id="gom-sir49-Nd1e280" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e283"><seg type="qs">Significat quod Joseph</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et sepelierunt in Sichem, quae est Neapolis, urbs Samaritanorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir49-Dd1e292">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir49-Hd1e294">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir49-d1e296">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir49-Qd1e298" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir49_19@1-3">Seth et Sem,</quote>
            etc. Seth filius Adam, et Sem primogenitus Noe, tam fide quam moribus hominibus sui temporis praelati sunt; in quibus Christus significatur, qui Deus et homo est.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
